- Valid `0444` files and `0555` directories fail staging or cleanup, potentially stranding journals and backup tombs.

All prescribed gates otherwise pass: focused `88 passed, 1 skipped`, full `658 passed, 20 skipped`, strict mypy, Ruff, build, and diff check.

